   "titulo": "Me, te, le, nos, les",
   "texto": [
    "To say **a quién**: **me** (to me), **te** (to you), **lhe** (to you, to him, to her), **nos** (to us), **lhes** (to them or you).",
    "Example: **Disse-lhe que sim** (I said yes). As in Spanish, **lhe** serves «l» and «to you»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Position",
   "texto": [
    "Just like the other pronouns: behind the verb with script in the affirmative phrase (**dei-lhe**, I gave it), and in front with **não** or **nunca** (**não lhe disse**, I didn't tell you)."
   ]
